"lahum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","location":"67:5:11","transliteration":{"text":"ʿadhāba"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّعِيرِ","location":"67:5:12","transliteration":{"text":"l-saʿīri"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٥","location":"67:5:13","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"And olsun ki, yakın göğü kandillerle donattık, onları şeytanlar için taşlamalar yaptık ve şeytanlara çılgın alev azabını hazırladık.","transliteration":"walaqad zayyannā l-samāa l-dun'yā bimaṣābīḥa wajaʿalnāhā rujūman lilshayāṭīni wa-aʿtadnā lahum ʿadhāba l-saʿīri"},{"id":5247,"verse_key":"67:6","verse_number":6,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّذِينَ","location":"67:6:1","transliteration":{"text":"walilladhīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","location":"67:6:2","transliteration":{"text":"kafarū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","location":"67:6:3","transliteration":{"text":"birabbihim"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَذَابُ","location":"67:6:4","transliteration":{"text":"ʿadhābu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ ۖ","location":"67:6:5","transliteration":{"text":"jahannama"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَبِئْسَ","location":"67:6:6","transliteration":{"text":"wabi'sa"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","location":"67:6:7","transliteration":{"text":"l-maṣīru"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٦","location":"67:6:8","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Rablerini inkar eden kimseler için cehennem azabı vardır. Ne kötü bir dönüştür!","transliteration":"walilladhīna kafarū birabbihim ʿadhābu jahannama wabi'sa l-maṣīru"},{"id":5248,"verse_key":"67:7","verse_number":7,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","location":"67:7:1","transliteration":{"text":"idhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أُلْقُوا۟","location":"67:7:2","transliteration":{"text":"ul'qū"}}