:10","transliteration":{"text":"khazanatuhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","location":"67:8:11","transliteration":{"text":"alam"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَأْتِكُمْ","location":"67:8:12","transliteration":{"text":"yatikum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","location":"67:8:13","transliteration":{"text":"nadhīrun"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٨","location":"67:8:14","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Nerede ise öfkesinden paralanacak! İçine her bir topluluğun atılmasında, bekçileri onlara: \"Size bir uyarıcı gelmemiş miydi?\" diye sorarlar.","transliteration":"takādu tamayyazu mina l-ghayẓi kullamā ul'qiya fīhā fawjun sa-alahum khazanatuhā alam yatikum nadhīrun"},{"id":5250,"verse_key":"67:9","verse_number":9,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","location":"67:9:1","transliteration":{"text":"qālū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰ","location":"67:9:2","transliteration":{"text":"balā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَدْ","location":"67:9:3","transliteration":{"text":"qad"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"جَآءَنَا","location":"67:9:4","transliteration":{"text":"jāanā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","location":"67:9:5","transliteration":{"text":"nadhīrun"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَكَذَّبْنَا","location":"67:9:6","transliteration":{"text":"fakadhabnā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَقُلْنَا","location":"67:9:7","transliteration":{"text":"waqul'nā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَا","location":"67:9:8","transliteration":{"text":"mā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَزَّلَ","location":"67:9:9","transliteration":{"text":"nazzala"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","location":"67:9:10","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِن","location":"67:9:11","transliteration":{"text":"min"}},{"char_type_name